  "variables": {},
  "strings": {
    "en": {
      "123506da36de44038f58228b459ce26f.title": "Dragon",
      "123506da36de44038f58228b459ce26f.text": "Peddler of potions and trinkets!",
      "5e147730ddee484cbc5db5652e1553d5.title": "Dragon",
      "5e147730ddee484cbc5db5652e1553d5.text": "Keeper of comforts!",
      "df4c92641eb84ef89bade948f696a5bb.title": "Dragon",
      "df4c92641eb84ef89bade948f696a5bb.text": "The time for repayment has come!",
      "fc975ebdad0d4abd9dc0172c8d4f0876.title": "Dialogue",
      "fc975ebdad0d4abd9dc0172c8d4f0876.text": "W-Who's t-there?!?",
      "7c046b64da074d568a1e08db154ad441.title": "Dialogue",
      "7c046b64da074d568a1e08db154ad441.text": "You are not the Lowly Mortal I seek. Where is the Warden of The Wandering Mug?",
      "dc8fe040fb7440d5b96923a8f7e20099.title": "Dialogue",
      "dc8fe040fb7440d5b96923a8f7e20099.text": "Do you mean my... g-great-grand... uh... something twice removed?",
      "317dfb207c0d428a9ee18902af7badff.title": "Dialogue",
      "317dfb207c0d428a9ee18902af7badff.text": "The ties of blood have no relevance to me; where is this tavern's keeper?",
      "cd492a0833704027adebf471e90656b1.title": "Dialogue",
      "cd492a0833704027adebf471e90656b1.text": "Well, I-I'm the new owner. I've inherited this tavern. ",
      "820cc0abf2c242109f4535a764c10862.title": "Dialogue",
      "820cc0abf2c242109f4535a764c10862.text": "Then their debt now falls upon your shoulders. ",
      "dcbe89e323d24155a3f620d63921f3a5.title": "Dialogue",
      "dcbe89e323d24155a3f620d63921f3a5.text": "D-Debt?!?",
      "e054ae112958466e9b76b962c0a1cadb.title": "Dialogue",
      "e054ae112958466e9b76b962c0a1cadb.text": "Indeed. ",
      "84b25925ca194e638b526e6789e77d63.title": "Dialogue",
      "84b25925ca194e638b526e6789e77d63.text": "I wasn't told about any debt. ",
      "84885fd5281749a594db3a7e26e89c17.title": "Dialogue",
      "84885fd5281749a594db3a7e26e89c17.text": "A failure on your predecessor's part. However, our bargain still holds. ",
      "734a14e9ca384eaf84cb4826a63ac09f.title": "Dialogue",
      "734a14e9ca384eaf84cb4826a63ac09f.text": "What bargain?!",
      "a8a1c2676357455e98f1c871d35b4618.title": "Dialogue",
      "a8a1c2676357455e98f1c871d35b4618.text": " A Dragon's Bargain TM. With a special sort of magics known as a high interest loan. Your predecessor borrowed from my hoard to build this very tavern. ",
      "79d09b67323c463d99588f3aa2ccc7a3.title": "Dialogue",
      "79d09b67323c463d99588f3aa2ccc7a3.text": "Its walls, its hearth, its very foundation were built from my hoard. ",
      "df28f6796f7c4fa9a8c823f63a989ba2.title": "Dialogue",
      "df28f6796f7c4fa9a8c823f63a989ba2.text": "... How much do I owe?",
      "fd4a4ac0b87c4329b5107a415f6cd25b.title": "Dialogue",
      "fd4a4ac0b87c4329b5107a415f6cd25b.text": "Oh, nothing terribly unreasonable... 50,000 Gold. ",
      "4688172032284e098a963ef45ea33c2d.title": "Dialogue",
      "4688172032284e098a963ef45ea33c2d.text": "I've never even seen that much gold in my life!",
      "068e71f7d40346e59fc8db83c756c0aa.title": "Dialogue",
      "068e71f7d40346e59fc8db83c756c0aa.text": "Unsurprising, but the stipulations of our contract still remain. The gold must be paid in full or there will be reprisals. I suggest you find a way to obtain my gold before my new arrival. ",
      "30aa981c40024a99bd764184c3c5aa79.title": "Dialogue",
      "30aa981c40024a99bd764184c3c5aa79.text": "With that, I will take my leave! A good day to you. Ta-ta!"
    }
  },
